          "headline": "Iran says its drones hit a US radar in Bahrain; Bahrain says it stopped the attacks",
          "summary": "Iran's Revolutionary Guards say six drones struck a US air-defence radar at the Riffa helicopter base in Bahrain and that the Strait of Hormuz is closed. Blasts and sirens were heard in Bahrain around 4 am and 6:30 am local time; Bahrain issued its first shelter alerts since September and says its air defences intercepted several Iranian attacks. This is the second Iranian claim on a US target in Bahrain in three days; the US has not confirmed it.",
